#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:80
#: 16ee3c10f38f4a2ca3fd21c99edf11d3
#, python-brace-format, python-format
msgid ""
"**`gettext-translator` (`82.5 / 100`)**: The strongest third-party "
"standalone CLI. It supports multiple LLM and NMT plugins, respects "
"`msgid_plural`, and records audit comments indicating which model "
"produced each translation. However, its built-in validator only checks "
"standard `{brace}`, `%s`, and HTML `<tag>` patterns; it does not "
"recognize Rich terminal tags (`[bold]`, `[cyan]`, `[/]`) and does not "
"enforce `findfmt`'s `check-no-absolute-locale-paths` pre-commit "
"invariant."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:86
#: 7df8b8eb852e4243b5e2bd6ecaf3287d
msgid ""
"**`pytlai` (`61.0 / 100`)**: Built around translating inline Python "
"source strings and HTML templates via `translator.process()` before "
"exporting `.po` files. It lacks native gettext `ngettext` multi-plural "
"(`msgstr[0]` .. `msgstr[5]`) synthesis and fuzzy-flag lifecycle "
"management."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/guides/ai_translation_benchmark.md:90
#: b6bc8ac776fb496aa7fc734131ebc1ef
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**`auto-gettext-translator` (`52.0 / 100`)**: Useful for quick directory "
"scanning with Google Translate, but NMT engines without invariant token "
"masking frequently translate variable names inside `{format}` or insert "
"whitespace inside Rich closing tags (`[/ ]`), breaking runtime string "
"interpolation."
msgstr ""

